db834ea22b41b54535","message":"security: close SEC-13/14/15, integrate the selective security package, and verify the restore matrix on CPython 3.12.10\n\nApplies the preserved full security state on top of 5a3e47dd and adds the\nSEC-13 password policy/lifecycle, SEC-14 OCR override validation and SEC-15\nHost/proxy boundary, with their acceptance suites (phase 58, 59) and a new\nfailure-mode suite (phase 60: disk-full, restore failure, permission denied).\n\nVerification (see docs/security/PHASE5_CI_312_EXECUTION_REPORT.md):\n  * CPython 3.12.10 built from source; lockfile installed with --require-hashes\n  * full suite: 1373 passed, 0 failed, 6 skipped (was 20 failed on 3.11.2)\n  * the 20 interpreter-gated tests now pass; no restore/backup skips remain\n  * restore matrix, key rotation/recovery, isolated restore, trial balance,\n    audit chain and vault backup/restore E2E all executed\n  * Local File Vault: 0600 blobs/keys, tenant isolation, tamper refusal,\n    16-way concurrency, rotation v1->v2, permission-denied fail-closed\n  * ruff, compileall, dependency graph clean; 53 locked packages checked\n    against the GitHub Advisory Database: 0 matches (old pins: 8/8 flagged)\n\nPackaging: B2 remains open. The wheel is not a V1 delivery artefact (no ops\nassets, no lockfile, no server entry point); V1 deploys from the source tree,\nverified end to end (docs/security/PACKAGING_DECISION_V1.md).\n\nTest-file changes are disclosed in the report: two fixture passwords follow the\nnew 8-character floor, the protected-operation pin moves 33 -> 35 as an exact\nequality, and one never-executed phase-58 restore test had its call site and\nreport-shape assertion corrected. No assertion was removed, no skip added.","timestamp":"2026-11-09T20:46:48Z","author":{"name":"Arena Agent","email":"agent@arena.ai"},"committer":{"name":"Arena Agent","email":"agent@arena.ai"}},"repository":{"id":1423374444,"node_id":"R_kgDOVNb4bA","name":"ERP","full_name":"Devmraustro/ERP","private":fa